title: Chapter1_0
position: -380,180
---
Sir Oreon: HOLD IT! Who are you and why do you want to enter this domain?
-> I couldn't help but shivers at his voice
    Adventurer: [shake]I-I-I-[/shake]
    Sir Oreon: SPEAK UP!!
    <<SetScissorsValue 0.5>>
-> Introduce yourself
    Adventurer: I am here for the duel with the ultimate cookie! Now get out.
    Sir Oreon: Foolish beings...
    Sir Oreon: You dare to challenge the ultimate cookie?!
    <<SetPaperalue 0.5>>
-> Ignore him
    You try to shove him away. 
    <<PlayTimeline "enemyStorySprite_Shake_Anim">>
    However the man is a brick wall with his muscle.
    <<SetRockValue 0.5>>
<<jump Chapter1_1>>
